SUMMARY:Everybody But You Bro Comedy Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nJoin Eyes Up Here Comedy & Modelface Co
 medy Club for the premiere open mic for the rest of us -- Everybody But Yo
 u Bro is a comedy mic for women\, non-binary\, queer and femme folks to ta
 ke the stage and tell jokes -- up to 5 minutes.\n\nThis is a queer and tra
 ns-inclusive mic.\nWe don’t punch down y’all!\n\nSign ups at 6pm and s
 hows starts at 6:30pm and it’s show up and go up! Located in the Comedy 
 Basement at The RAD Brew Co.\nAll are welcome for the audience\, however h
 ecklers will be asked to leave\n\nFree event\, Suggested $10 donations are
  highly encouraged\nHosted by Erin Terry\, Danny Felix and Linda Barsi\nSt
 ick around after the mic for our Joke Writing Workshop at 8pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-comedy-fans/events/31507704
 5/
